  "assumptions_and_not_proven": [
    "Model A only: same initial normalized capital, no subsequent external cash flows. Formal full-follow model versus original relative adjusted-NAV units held unchanged; no periodic fixed-weight rebalance in frozen branch.",
    "Formal NAV is a published PMS model value, not the actual client account wealth. Candidate rebuild uses OLD units valued at each adjustment close, transaction expense, then NEW target units purchased at that same close.",
    "Fund adjusted NAV includes its own embedded operating expenses and distribution adjustment. Do not deduct management/custody/fund sales-service operating expenses a second time.",
    "PMS fund-fee configuration is a model schedule, not each client actual holding-period redemption fee or broker discount. Model NAV does not establish that all client advisor service fees, actual transaction fees, confirmation lag and slippage are included.",
    "Selected candidate fee convention is identical for all eight: previous-transaction-date drift weights, explicit C-share suffix or money type04 -> class3 zero model allot/redeem, bond type02 -> class2, other -> class1; historical date-specific config applied linearly to weight change. Official NAV amounts are not input to reconstruction or substituted as per-event fees; one common convention was selected during reconciliation, with no per-strategy endpoint fitting.",
    "Fee-base, rounding and historical fund type interpretation remain source-code qualification items. Ten uniformly applied plausible conventions were compared as sensitivity cases; no per-strategy endpoint fitting was performed.",
    "Two missing current type records 002643 and 000590 are named mixed funds and assigned model other class1; no historical type mutation evidence has been retrieved.",
    "Low-volatility strategy 012930 had target date2021-08-18 before first available NAV2021-08-20=1.0. The diagnostic replay explicitly uses issue-price1.0; subscription/recognition rule remains unverified.",
    "Fifteen final-date QDII prices are carried from last published available dates2026-10-16 or2026-10-19; this is a disclosed model as-of-price convention, not evidence of executable cash liquidation at that time.",
    "All displayed terminal capital is mark-to-market on2026-10-20, with no hypothetical terminal forced-liquidation fee. Actual client external inflow/outflow and realized proceeds require the separate client replay.",
    "Independent reviewer recalculated all eight follow/frozen paths without using official NAV amounts as input; terminal values agree to <=2.45e-15 with this candidate implementation.",
    "Sensitivity reclassifying the two missing-type mixed funds as bond fee class narrows low-vol-enhanced replay contribution from about -2.9827bp to -0.1154bp of initial principal. It is therefore near-flat; do not characterize the tiny negative as strong economic evidence of harm.",
    "Sensitivity varying012930 pre-first-NAV assumed issue price by +/-0.1% shifts low-vol model contribution by about +/-0.1224bp of initial principal; direction unchanged. This robustness check does not verify the subscription-price convention.",
    "Annualization is ACT/365.25: geometric terminal/start return raised to365.25 divided by actual calendar days."
